  "limitations": [
    "No full deployed gateway-price-realtime-Core stack. External environment skips recorded per class.",
    "No shared-JVM GC/CPU/native memory, sustained throughput, p99 or long-duration validation; no performance improvement claim.",
    "Core/client-pool drivers unchanged. No Core JMH: only app-side driver deployment/lifecycle changed, same transport/threading mode.",
    "Gateway restart interrupts shared app transport; live events during outage are not guaranteed to replay.",
    "One driver owner per local directory; deployment assumes co-located applications."
  ],
